DESCRIPTION:In this 45 minute workshop\, participants will learn how to pr
 epare a classic milk bubble tea\, including decorating and mixing techniqu
 es\, as well as the breakdown of core ingredients. A classic lidded cup an
 d straw will be provided to enjoy the boba as you go!\nTo secure a spot\, 
 register online. Remaining spots will be awarded on a first come\, first s
 erved basis.\nPlease be aware that food will be used in this program.\nCer
 tain food ingredients may cause allergic reactions in some people\n.\nFood
  allergy notice:\nThis program uses food items that contain dairy\nPlease 
 note that this is a program for Teens.\nInformation Collection Notice:\nTh
 e personal information on this form is collected by the Toronto Public Lib
 rary under the Public Libraries Act\, sections 20(a)\, 20(c)\, and 20(d). 
 The information will only be used for event and program registration\, del
 ivery and evaluation. Questions about how the library handles your informa
